    bio_short:
      "Google “Christian Boo Boucousis” and you’ll discover a world-class speaker with hundreds of reviews attesting to his life changing insights, ranking him 4.9/5.0 (as Boo says, no one’s perfect!), one of the world’s most impactful and…",
