        name: "Making space in the digital world",
        description:
          "Is your team busy and distracted, overloaded with work, and struggling to get the right things done? What if the secret to achieving your best was making space for less? Could unplugging from digital distractions be the pathway to your best work and life? Online meetings, hybrid working, and generative AI is here to stay, requiring a rethink in the way we structure our time and attention. New strategies are required to make space for our health, happiness, and productivity. This popular keynote will encourage you to rethink your relationship with the online world and manage digital overload. Audiences will leave with practical strategies to 'keep pace' and 'make space'—learning to habitually unplug and unwind to focus on what truly matters.",
