      "For a decade, Div has listened to the stories of women and people of color regarding exclusion in Australian workplaces, offering valuable insights into fostering inclusivity. As co-host of the podcast Business in Colour , she has led over 70 conversations with top leaders about workplace diversity and inclusion, while also contributing her thought leadership to prominent media outlets such as ABC, SBS, and the Sydney Morning Herald.",
