      "Erika Cramer is a leadership and performance speaker, mindset expert and bestselling author who helps individuals and organisations build the confidence, resilience and mental toughness to perform at their best when it matters most.",
      "A U.S. Army veteran and TEDx speaker, she has personally coached more than 20,000 leaders across every major industry and built a podcast with over 3 million downloads in nearly 200 countries.",
