      "A Journalist and editor, Georgie is a contributing Editor of Women’s Agenda, Australia’s leading publication for career-minded women, columnist in The Sydney Morning Herald and The Age on Sunday, regular contributor to Marie Claire Magazine. Her work has also been feature in The Guardian, Harper's Bazaar and The Financial Review.",
      "She is an expert facilitator and keynote speaker, her clients including ANZ, Westpac, Bank of Queensland, The Growth Faculty, Hall & Wilcox, Smart Women Connect, Twitter and Griffith University.",
