        name: "Perfectionism is making you miserable",
        description:
          "It’s easy to think of perfectionism as a humblebrag, but it’s actually far more toxic. Georgie can help an audience recognise the signs of perfectionism, how it relates to depression and anxiety and provide practical strategies to pivot towards a more sustainable way of life.",
